= June 2025 — The original contract, under new pressure

Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** still leads the cabinet built by KO,
Poland 2050, PSL and Lewica. The runoff does not dissolve that agreement. It
changes the price of every clause: KO must defend the premiership, Poland 2050
and PSL must prove that their hinge still matters, and Lewica must show what
its ministries delivered.

[? if pres_2025_hostile_president: A hostile President can veto the programme
the four parties promised. Before blaming the Palace, the cabinet must show
that all four signatures still produce a Sejm majority.?][? if not
