= June 2025 — PSL chose government over Third Way

The cabinet belongs to KO, PSL and Lewica. Poland 2050 never received a
ministry; any votes it supplies remain toleration, not coalition ownership.
Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** therefore depends on an agrarian partner
inside the room and a wounded centrist competitor outside it.

[? if pres_2025_hostile_president: The Palace can now reward Poland 2050 for
distance and invite PSL to defect issue by issue. A confidence count tests
whether the split arrangement still reaches a majority.?][? if not
