= June 2025 — Reformers inside, agrarians outside

KO, Poland 2050 and Lewica hold the ministries. PSL did not sign the cabinet
contract and owes it only the outside votes it explicitly promised. That makes
rights and institutional reform easier to write, but budgets and rural policy
harder to carry through the chamber.

[? if pres_2025_hostile_president: A hostile Palace gives PSL a second auction
for every vetoed bill. The cabinet must prove its three-party core can still
assemble confidence before calling itself a majority.?][? if not
pres_2025_hostile_president: A friendly signature strengthens the reformist
core and raises PSL's price on agriculture, spending and local government.?]

