= June 2025 — No borrowed history

PiS and Lewica chose to govern together under Prime Minister **[+
prime_minister +]**. PiS owns the state programme it demanded; Lewica owns the
social guarantees and offices it accepted in return. KO, PSL and Poland 2050
remain outside this contract, however loudly they invoke the coalition that
might have been.

