= Lewica is not the government

The cabinet's base count excludes Lewica. Opposition adds no yes votes;
abstention adds no yes votes; only explicit support can rescue the cabinet.

- @confidence_oppose_2025
- @confidence_abstain_2025
- @confidence_rescue_2025

@confidence_oppose_2025
title: Vote against the cabinet
subtitle: Act as opposition and make KO survive without votes it never negotiated.
on-arrival: confidence_2025_bonus = 0; confidence_2025_left_yes = 0; confidence_2025_left_no = confidence_2025_left_pool; confidence_2025_left_abstain = 0; confidence_2025_left_posture = "Opposition — vote no"; party_unity += 2; ko_relation -= 3; news_headline = "Lewica votes against a cabinet it does not control"

Every Lewica MP votes no. Our factions recover a clean opposition line; KO
must find its own majority and cannot call our seats part of its base.

- @confidence_2025_roll: Count the confidence vote

