on-arrival: confidence_2025_bonus = 0; confidence_2025_left_yes = 0; confidence_2025_left_no = 0; confidence_2025_left_abstain = confidence_2025_left_pool; confidence_2025_left_posture = "Opposition — abstain"; budget_promises += 2; ko_relation += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; public_mood_pending_social_spending_support += 5; public_mood_pending_social_spending_left_ownership += -4; news_headline = "Lewica withholds support after extracting a delivery protocol"

We refuse to rescue the cabinet but make abstention carry labour and housing
dates. KO gains room in the count; progressives ask why promises deserved even
that much help.

- @confidence_2025_roll: Count the confidence vote

@confidence_rescue_2025
title: Supply enough votes to rescue the democratic cabinet
subtitle: Rescue the democratic cabinet from outside and accept a visible Left split.
on-arrival: {!
Q.confidence_2025_left_yes = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.confidence_2025_left_pool) || 0) * 0.72
);
Q.confidence_2025_left_no = 0;
Q.confidence_2025_left_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.confidence_2025_left_pool) || 0) -
        Q.confidence_2025_left_yes
);
Q.confidence_2025_bonus = 0;
Q.confidence_2025_left_posture =
    "Opposition — partial rescue vote";
Q.ko_relation += 6;
Q.party_unity -= 5;
Q.razem_cooperation -= 6;
Q.news_headline =
