= 26 June 2025 — Speed, stamina, power, guts and wit

The English version of **Umamusume: Pretty Derby** goes live on mobile and PC.
The simulation follows runners inspired by real racehorses as they train toward
the Twinkle Series. By midnight, half the digital team is discussing campaign
planning through five suspiciously transferable attributes. The other half has
noticed the paid random draws.

This is not a national crisis. It is, however, the only paper on the desk whose
authors have modelled a three-year training schedule down to the final turn.

- @umamusume_train
- @umamusume_regulate
- @umamusume_log_off

